#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/scvmm/scvmm.rst:64
msgid "**SCVMM Specific Advanced Options**"
msgstr "**SCVMM Specific Advanced Options**"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/scvmm/scvmm.rst:66
msgid "INSTALL AGENT"
msgstr "INSTALL AGENT"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/scvmm/scvmm.rst:67
msgid ""
"Enabled by default, INSTALL AGENT installs the |morpheus| agent on the "
"scvmm Controller when adding the cloud, which is required for full "
"functionally unless using a shared controller in which scenario the agent"
" would already be installed on the scvmm controller node. Disabling "
"INSTALL AGENT on the cloud config when not using a shared controller will"
" remove the ability to provision to the cloud."
msgstr ""
"Enabled por defecto, INSTALL AGENT installs el |morpheus| agent on el "
"scvmm Controller cuando adding la nube, cual es requerido para full "
"functionally unless using un shared controller in cual scenario el agente"
" sería ya be instalado on el scvmm controller node. Disabling INSTALL "
"AGENT on la nube config cuando no using un shared controller será remove "
"el ability to provision to la nube."

